==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=cleaner (disambiguation)|cleaner}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈkliː.nɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|iːnə(r)|lang=en}}

===Etymology 1===
{{-er|clean}} ([[agent noun]])

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A person whose occupation is to clean floors, windows and other things.
# A device that [[clean]]s, such as the [[vacuum cleaner]].
# A cleaning [[detergent]].
# {{context|in the plural|lang=en}} A professional [[laundry]] or [[dry cleaner]] {{gloss|business}}.
#: ''I'll have to take this shirt to the '''cleaners'''.''

